==Bengali==
{{wp|bn:+ ধর্ম|sc=Beng}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|bn|ar|يَهُودِيّ}}, which was borrowed from {{der|bn|arc|יְהוּדָיֵא|tr=yəhūḏāyā}}, from {{der|bn|he|יהודי|tr=yehudí}} (see more at {{der|bn|he|יְהוּדָה|tr=y'hudá}}). Cognate with {{cog|as|ইহুদী}}, {{cog|hi|यहूदी}}, {{cog|ur|یَہُودِی}}, {{cog|ne|यंहुदि}}, {{cog|gu|યહૂદી}}, {{cog|pa|ਯਹੂਦੀ}} / {{m|pa|یَہُودِی}}.

